  "title": "Proposed Maui County passenger ferry to Molokaʻi and Lānaʻi",
  "summary": "At a September 17 community meeting, Maui County Department of Transportation staff said the passenger-only ferry project is \"not a done deal,\" and a draft environmental assessment will be released for public comment. Residents said they need an affordable ferry now, not by the hoped-for early 2029 Molokaʻi start. Lānaʻi service is estimated at about $5 million a year, with tickets covering about 60 percent, and the County Council will set fares.",
